{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You remember nothing but your own name, and begin a new life in a peaceful village \u2014 with a small house and a borrowed field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Till the soil, go fishing, cook, forge, fall in love, care for your pets, explore the world, and teach a mysterious girl what it means to &quot;enjoy&quot; a meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.poster.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.webm?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.mp4?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your land your way \u2014 easy to pick up, yet full of depth if you dig in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crops aren\u2019t just for sale; turn them into meals, gifts, or even materials for your forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pal up with monsters to help out around the farm, or make life easier with whimsical tools like floating magic sprinklers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.poster.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.webm?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.mp4?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the world and face a variety of dungeons and formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal dungeons, ever-changing ruins, and the Dark Queen\u2019s castle await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with villagers or tamed monsters, bring bento boxes, and take on special monsters with unique abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROMANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/7d0b983fd7e7b1346592dc3241bccde6.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy everyday life and seasonal festivals with the villagers, each living life in their own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build friendships through requests and activities, then invite them on adventures, go on dates, or even get married \u2014 making your life in Farnia Village truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128600?t=1774513530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/c937f44c20d2d785807ee8888ae63d399c3b6ace/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774513530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/99aba29abe594ee6b93e9dde9ba096e826df3eb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774513530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/99aba29abe594ee6b93e9dde9ba096e826df3eb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774513530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You remember nothing but your own name, and begin a new life in a peaceful village \u2014 with a small house and a borrowed field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Till the soil, go fishing, cook, forge, fall in love, care for your pets, explore the world, and teach a mysterious girl what it means to &quot;enjoy&quot; a meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.poster.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.webm?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/d4a479c0027b1d59e7c9c0bed57843c1.mp4?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your land your way \u2014 easy to pick up, yet full of depth if you dig in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crops aren\u2019t just for sale; turn them into meals, gifts, or even materials for your forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pal up with monsters to help out around the farm, or make life easier with whimsical tools like floating magic sprinklers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.poster.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.webm?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/4b4305db889d76bc8ae8e95ceed5568b.mp4?t=1774513530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the world and face a variety of dungeons and formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal dungeons, ever-changing ruins, and the Dark Queen\u2019s castle await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with villagers or tamed monsters, bring bento boxes, and take on special monsters with unique abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROMANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/extras/7d0b983fd7e7b1346592dc3241bccde6.avif?t=1774513530\" width=610 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy everyday life and seasonal festivals with the villagers, each living life in their own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build friendships through requests and activities, then invite them on adventures, go on dates, or even get married \u2014 making your life in Farnia Village truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MNGS\uff08\u30de\u30ca\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30b9\uff09"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128600/6030cc96979e5f786672e0683d4d4bd90913d1b3/header.jpg?t=1774513530","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"mi