ive in\u2026\u201d With no memory and a small home given to you, a new life in the village begins! Tend fields, fish, cook, forge, fall in love, care for pets, explore the world, and teach a mysterious girl what it means to &quot;enjoy&quot; a meal.","steam_appid":4128600,"support_info":{"email":"manabe@managames.biz","url":"https://x.com/FarniaVillage"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}